# An example exchange calendar (spec 0061): the New York Stock Exchange's full-day closures for 2026 and 2027.
# The dates follow NYSE's published holiday rules, but an exchange can change its schedule (a national day of
# mourning, a market-wide closure), so check them against the exchange's own announcement before relying on
# them, and extend Covers every year.
#
# This file is the calendar `us/nyse`. Put it in force with
# `borg admin reload-calendars` (the daily admin/reload_calendars job does it too), then see it with
# `borg admin calendar show us/nyse --year 2026` and check a day with
# `borg admin calendar check us/nyse 20260403`.
#
# A job that runs after every NYSE trading day:
#
#   Name: eod/prices
#   Calendar: us/nyse
#   Days: b
#   StartAfter: 21:30
#
# and one that must run the next trading day, early (so after Good Friday it runs on Monday):
#
#   Calendar: us/nyse
#   StartAfter: 1b+06:00
#
# Things to know about exchange calendars:
#  * A holiday on a Saturday is observed the Friday before, on a Sunday the Monday after. NYSE does not close on
#    a Friday 31 December for a New Year's Day that falls on a Saturday (so 2027-12-31 is a trading day).
#  * NYSE closes on Good Friday, which is not a US federal holiday, and stays open on Columbus Day and Veterans
#    Day, which are. An exchange calendar is not the federal one.
#  * Early closes (13:00 ET on the day after Thanksgiving and usually on Christmas Eve) are trading days here:
#    a calendar says only whether a day is worked. A job that cares uses its own StartAfter.
#  * A job that needs both the exchange and the banks open (settlement) names both:
#    `Calendar: us/nyse, us/federal` works only on a day that works in both.
Description: New York Stock Exchange, full-day closures

Weekend: sat, sun
Covers: 2026-01-01..2027-12-31

# 2026
Holiday: 2026-01-01  New Year's Day
Holiday: 2026-01-19  Martin Luther King Jr. Day
Holiday: 2026-02-16  Washington's Birthday
Holiday: 2026-04-03  Good Friday
Holiday: 2026-05-25  Memorial Day
Holiday: 2026-06-19  Juneteenth National Independence Day
Holiday: 2026-07-03  Independence Day (observed; 4 July is a Saturday)
Holiday: 2026-09-07  Labor Day
Holiday: 2026-11-26  Thanksgiving Day
Holiday: 2026-12-25  Christmas Day

# 2027
Holiday: 2027-01-01  New Year's Day
Holiday: 2027-01-18  Martin Luther King Jr. Day
Holiday: 2027-02-15  Washington's Birthday
Holiday: 2027-03-26  Good Friday
Holiday: 2027-05-31  Memorial Day
Holiday: 2027-06-18  Juneteenth National Independence Day (observed; 19 June is a Saturday)
Holiday: 2027-07-05  Independence Day (observed; 4 July is a Sunday)
Holiday: 2027-09-06  Labor Day
Holiday: 2027-11-25  Thanksgiving Day
Holiday: 2027-12-24  Christmas Day (observed; 25 December is a Saturday)
